The release day is approximate. The curator records entry on November 11, 2024 and release at approximately November 27, and notes that one movement source has her beginning on November 12. Fifteen days from November 11 would end November 26; fifteen days from November 12 would end November 27 exactly. The curator's stated release is kept here rather than an arithmetic one, so this row measures sixteen days and the record totals thirty-one against a sentence described as about thirty. A confirmed jail discharge record would settle it."], "imprisoned_for_days": [15, 16]}

